EXPLICACIÓN:
Para decir NO SOY, NO ESTOY, NO ES, NO ERES, NO SOMOS, solo añade NOT después de am, is, are

Antes decías...	                             Ahora para negar dices...
I am                                         I am not
He / She / It / Claudia is	                 He is not = isn't
You / We / They / David and Dagui are	     You are not = aren't

TRUCO MENTAL:
AM NOT → solo para I. No se encoge. I am not a dog.
ISN'T = is + not → para uno solo. He isn't here.
AREN'T = are + not → para varios o YOU. They aren't ready.

ABREVIACIONES
Sujeto	                            Negación larga	         Negación corta (opcional)
I	                                am not	                 am not (no se encoge)
He / She / It / Claudia         	is not	                 isn't
You / We / They / David and Dagui	are not	                 aren't



